---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="The App · AutoDeck"
  description="Digital job cards with photos at every stage, warranty and service history on record, published prices and a maintenance calendar. The record follows the car."
  page="app"
>
  <section class="phero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The AutoDeck app</p>
    <h1>The record follows <em>the car.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Not a booking form. A living record of your car. Every stage photographed, every document kept, every date remembered.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="https://app.autodeck.in">Open the app <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <p class="fine">Runs in your browser today. App Store and Play Store soon.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="s"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid3" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)">
      <div class="card rv"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Watch the work</h3><p>Photos at every stage, as it happens. You never have to wonder.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Prove it years later</h3><p>Warranty, history and papers, ready the day you sell.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Know the price first</h3><p>Published prices before the car arrives. No surprises.</p></div>
      <div class="card rv"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Never miss a date</h3><p>Reminders that arrive before the due date does.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
